{"speciesId":579,"names":{"fr":"Symbios","es":"Reuniclus","en":"Reuniclus","ja":"ランクルス"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Quand ils se tiennent par la main, leurs cerveaux forment un réseau qui démultiplie leurs pouvoirs psychiques."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"When Reuniclus shake hands, a network forms between their brains, increasing their psychic power."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il combat avec ses bras assez puissants pour broyer des rochers. C’est un Pokémon très intelligent."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"These remarkably intelligent Pokémon fight by controlling arms that can grip with rock-crushing power."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"They use psychic power to control their arms, which are made of a special liquid. They can crush boulders psychically."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"They use psychic power to control their arms, which are made of a special liquid. They can crush boulders psychically."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Ses bras, faits d’une matière conduisant ses pouvoirs psychiques, sont assez puissants pour broyer des rochers."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Hacen gala de su poder psíquico y mueven sus brazos compuestos de líquido para controlar rocas y hacerlas añicos."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"They use psychic power to control their arms, which are made of a special liquid. They can crush boulders psychically."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"発揮した サイコパワーを 使い 特殊な 液体で つくられた 腕を 操り 岩を 砕く。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Quand ils se tiennent par la main, leurs cerveaux forment un réseau qui démultiplie leurs pouvoirs psychiques."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Cuando los Reuniclus se dan la mano, sus cerebros se conectan y multiplican sus poderes psíquicos."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"When Reuniclus shake hands, a network forms between their brains, increasing their psychic power."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"ランクルス 同士が 握手すると 脳みそが ネットワークで つながり サイコパワーが 増幅されるのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Ses bras, faits d’une matière conduisant ses pouvoirs psychiques, sont assez puissants pour broyer des rochers."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Hacen gala de su poder psíquico y mueven sus brazos compuestos de líquido para controlar rocas y hacerlas añicos."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"They use psychic power to control their arms, which are made of a special liquid. They can crush boulders psychically."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"発揮した サイコパワーを 使い 特殊な 液体で つくられた 腕を 操り 岩を 砕く。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Quand ils se tiennent par la main, leurs cerveaux forment un réseau qui démultiplie leurs pouvoirs psychiques."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Cuando los Reuniclus se dan la mano, sus cerebros se conectan y multiplican sus poderes psíquicos."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"When Reuniclus shake hands, a network forms between their brains, increasing their psychic power."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"ランクルス 同士が 握手すると 脳みそが ネットワークで つながり サイコパワーが 増幅されるのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Fier d’avoir des bras, il préfère s’en servir pour assommer ses adversaires plutôt que d’avoir recours à ses pouvoirs psychiques."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Prefiere derribar a los rivales haciendo girar sus fuertes brazos antes que valerse de sus poderes extrasensoriales."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"While it could use its psychic abilities in battle, this Pokémon prefers to swing its powerful arms around to beat opponents into submission."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"超能力を 使うよりも 自慢の 腕を ぶん回して 殴り倒すのを 好んでいる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"S’il ne s’agissait pas d’un poison violent que seul Symbios peut boire, son curieu